       Q: How should energy, raw_material, labor_hours, and machine_time be combined into a single 'total_resources_consumed' denominator — by physical units, monetary cost, or CO₂-equivalent weighting? (Different weightings can shift the optimiser's preferred decision by 20–50%.)
