    3. resource_efficiency (no minimum throughput floor)
       Q: Is there a minimum delivered-value output (e.g., at least 85% of the standard shift quota) that must be met regardless of the efficiency ratio achieved? Without a floor, the optimiser may legitimately run very few jobs to maximise value-per-resource at the expense of total output.
